WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:11.762
It turned out Dad's ankle was badly sprained.

2
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:14.962
He could not walk for two weeks.

3
00:00:14.963 --> 00:00:21.281
"Since I can't work, let's all take a little vacation," Dad said cheerfully.

4
00:00:21.282 --> 00:00:27.414
"We can spend more time in the attic," whispered Vinnie to Mandy.

5
00:00:27.415 --> 00:00:30.290
They started up the stairs.

6
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:35.546
"Mandy? I need your help," Mom called from the kitchen.

7
00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:38.667
"Coming, Mom!" Mandy yelled.

8
00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:41.004
Then she turned to Vinnie.

9
00:00:41.005 --> 00:00:44.621
"Wait for me," she said.

10
00:00:44.622 --> 00:00:47.244
"Well, you'd better hurry up!"

11
00:00:47.245 --> 00:00:50.809
he replied, running up the stairs.

12
00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:55.001
In the attic, Vinnie picked up the photo album.

13
00:00:55.002 --> 00:00:57.951
He wanted to open it so badly.

14
00:00:57.952 --> 00:01:01.002
He listened for Mandy's footsteps.

15
00:01:01.003 --> 00:01:04.222
He looked at the clock on the attic wall.

16
00:01:04.223 --> 00:01:07.539
Fifteen minutes had passed by.

17
00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:11.809
"Come on, Mandy!" he said aloud.

18
00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:15.535
Impatiently, Vinnie opened the album.

19
00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:18.412
He stared at the next photo.

20
00:01:18.413 --> 00:01:23.070
The old man was standing in front of a large domed building.

21
00:01:23.071 --> 00:01:26.567
It had four tall towers around it.

22
00:01:26.568 --> 00:01:32.099
The towers were glowing.

23
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:37.970
"Sorry, Mandy," Vinnie said, as his eyes closed.

24
00:01:37.971 --> 00:01:43.539
He fell down the dark tunnel.

25
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.501
He landed on something hard, though not as hard as the ground.

26
00:01:48.502 --> 00:01:51.559
But he wasn't alone.

27
00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.813
"Ouch!" Vinnie cried.

28
00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:57.728
"You tried to leave me again!"

29
00:01:57.729 --> 00:02:00.389
Mandy was pinching him.

30
00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.111
"I waited but you were taking too long,"

31
00:02:04.112 --> 00:02:06.889
Vinnie said, rubbing his arm.

32
00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:11.669
"You couldn't wait ten more seconds?" asked Mandy.

33
00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:15.876
Suddenly, something under them began to move.

34
00:02:15.877 --> 00:02:19.938
"Hey!" cried Vinnie. "What's happening?"

35
00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:25.311
"Vinnie! We didn't land on the ground," whispered Mandy.

36
00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:28.814
"We're on a camel!"

37
00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:34.377
The children were sitting in two saddles on a very large camel.

38
00:02:34.378 --> 00:02:38.021
"Where are we?" Mandy asked aloud.

39
00:02:38.022 --> 00:02:40.134
She looked around.

40
00:02:40.135 --> 00:02:46.070
Donkeys were pulling wagons loaded with wooden boxes of different sizes.

41
00:02:46.071 --> 00:02:49.048
Other wagons carried barrels.

42
00:02:49.049 --> 00:02:51.882
Some people rode on horses.

43
00:02:51.883 --> 00:02:55.348
Carpets were piled on top of camels.

44
00:02:55.349 --> 00:02:59.075
Everyone in the group moved slowly.

45
00:02:59.076 --> 00:03:03.268
"There are so many people!" said Vinnie.

46
00:03:03.269 --> 00:03:08.003
"And lots of animals too," added Mandy.

47
00:03:08.004 --> 00:03:11.808
"I wonder where we're going," said Vinnie.

48
00:03:11.809 --> 00:03:15.602
"Let me see the photo," said Mandy.

49
00:03:15.603 --> 00:03:17.735
Vinnie gave it to her.

50
00:03:17.736 --> 00:03:22.471
Mandy studied the photo for a moment.

51
00:03:22.472 --> 00:03:26.604
"It looks like a temple," she remarked.

52
00:03:26.605 --> 00:03:29.268
Their camel stopped suddenly.

53
00:03:29.269 --> 00:03:32.151
Everyone else had stopped too.

54
00:03:32.152 --> 00:03:36.001
A man on a horse stopped next to them.

55
00:03:36.002 --> 00:03:41.034
He was wearing a long robe and turban.

56
00:03:41.035 --> 00:03:45.879
"We are about to enter the city," he shouted to the travelers.

57
00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.628
"Look after your goods and animals.

58
00:03:48.629 --> 00:03:52.888
We don't want any strangers coming after our caravan."

59
00:03:52.889 --> 00:03:56.572
"Strangers?" Vinnie gulped.

60
00:03:56.573 --> 00:04:00.007
The man pointed ahead and cried,

61
00:04:00.008 --> 00:04:08.187
"To Istanbul—the greatest city in the great Ottoman Empire!"
